              <div class="ht-step-number">1</div>
              <div class="ht-step-body">
                <div class="ht-step-title">Open Review Warrants</div>
                <div class="ht-step-desc">Click <strong>Review Warrants</strong> in the sidebar. A badge shows how many warrants are pending review.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ht-step">
              <div class="ht-step-number">2</div>
              <div class="ht-step-body">
                <div class="ht-step-title">Read the warrant details</div>
                <div class="ht-step-desc">Review the warrant type, accused person, charges, probable cause, and the requesting officer's information.</div>
